@host = http://localhost:5180
@apiKey = replace-me

### List products - reads need no key
GET {{host}}/api/products?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### Search and filter
GET {{host}}/api/products?search=drill&categoryId=1
Accept: application/json

### One product, with stock derived from its movement log
GET {{host}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

### Create a product - writes need the key
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "sku": "TL-HAM-001",
  "name": "Claw hammer",
  "description": "16oz, fibreglass handle",
  "categoryId": 1
}

### Same request without the key - expect 401
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "TL-HAM-002",
  "name": "Should be rejected",
  "categoryId": 1
}

### Categories
GET {{host}}/api/categories
Accept: application/json

### Stock on hand for a product
GET {{host}}/api/products/1/stock
Accept: application/json

### Its movement history
GET {{host}}/api/products/1/movements
Accept: application/json

### Receive stock
POST {{host}}/api/products/1/movements
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "type": "In",
  "quantity": 25,
  "reason": "Delivery 4471"
}

### Issue stock
POST {{host}}/api/products/1/movements
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "type": "Out",
  "quantity": 4,
  "reason": "Sales order 1041"
}

### Issue more than exists - expect 400, never a negative balance
POST {{host}}/api/products/1/movements
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "type": "Out",
  "quantity": 999999,
  "reason": "Should be refused"
}

### Bulk import from CSV
POST {{host}}/api/products/import
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----boundary

------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="products.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

sku,name,description,category,quantity
IM-001,Imported hammer,"Heavy, steel",Tools,12
IM-002,Imported goggles,,Safety,3
------boundary--
